{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>《中年好聲音4》決賽在即，「白眉鷹王」莫家淦賽前特別為戰友「中4舞王」鄭家聲打氣，卻意外發現對方竟愁眉苦面，引發擔憂。面對關心，鄭家聲親自解畫，更重磅預告決賽將為觀眾帶來一個演唱會級的快歌表演，究竟他能否將壓力轉化為舞台上的終極驚喜？</p><p>莫家淦隔空打氣 驚見鄭家聲愁眉苦面</p><p>雖然已於16強止步，「白眉鷹王」莫家淦依然心繫一眾《中4》戰友，他特意拍片為被他睇好能直入決賽的「中4舞王」鄭家聲打氣。不過，莫家淦敏銳地觀察到家聲的狀態似乎不佳，直接在鏡頭前問道：「好似咁多心事嘅呢？」他坦言不明白為何家聲經常愁眉苦面，並鼓勵對方要在決賽舞台上，帶給大家意想不到的驚喜，言詞間充滿對戰友的關懷與期待。</p><p>鄭家聲親解謎團 預告炮製演唱會級作品</p><p>面對莫家淦的疑問，鄭家聲坦承決賽最期待的環節正是快歌部分，因為整個演出是他與舞蹈員共同構思的成果，希望能呈現出一個全新的版本。他詳細解釋道：「想做一個新嘅版本，但係某啲部份你會懷念致敬原唱，帶到一個演唱會級嘅作品畀大家。」從他的言談中，可見其愁容背後，是對表演的極高要求與巨大壓力，誓要為觀眾帶來一個顛覆想像的舞台。</p><p>網民期待值爆燈：「舞王出手必屬佳品！」</p><p>對於鄭家聲的預告，網民紛紛表示期待值爆燈，留言為他打氣。「好期待家聲嘅快歌舞台！一定好炸！」「愁眉苦面可能係因為要求高，對自己有壓力，係好事嚟！」「演唱會級作品？講到咁勁，唔好令人失望啊！」「支持 鄭家聲 ！舞王出手必屬佳品！」</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/01_19123335596a891a0ecd5e4.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/02_4362229086a891a14241ff.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/03_21226785506a891a174c182.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/04_2992016186a891a1b42684.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/05_5544507966a891a1f729cc.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/06_15814567776a891a239be8d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/07_6174844576a891a287213d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/08_830219986a891a2bdd834.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/09_3662474496a891a304ca18.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/10_20662449256a891a348e493.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/11_6034776526a891a3845ed4.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/12_8686359816a891a3c5d836.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/13_13991516626a891a404a95a.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/14_10710008136a891a4493b84.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/15_15941161436a891a486c48b.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/16_13172942306a891a4e37af9.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/17_16353173896a891a519efaa.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/18_10925401496a891a555c6cb.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/19_2510129436a891a58bfc7d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/20_12885185476a891a5d07b6c.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/21_2789813016a891a610d223.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/22_18554299966a891a64e5003.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？</p><p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了 香港演唱會2025一覽 ，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p><p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？</p><p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的 親子好去處 、拍拖推介32大 情侶好去處 、落雨必去的 室內好去處 、慶生推薦20大 生日好去處 、新手必備19大靚景 行山好去處 、秋天戶外 露營好去處 …..</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-22T03:59:38.453659+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":866,"images":22,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}